\title{Vanadium Redox Flow Storage for the Tasiilaq Island Microgrid:\newline Design, Performance, and Economics}
\author{K.~I.~Petersen, M.~Lund, and A.~S.~Olsen}
\date{June 2026}

\begin{document}
\maketitle

\begin{abstract}
The Tasiilaq microgrid added a vanadium redox flow battery to displace diesel generation.
We report the design basis, two years of operating data, and the project economics.
The battery delivers an RTE above eighty percent and has cut diesel use by a third.
\end{abstract}

